   "part": null,
   "latex": "$f(x)=\\int 3-2e^{-x}\\,dx=3x+2e^{-x}+c$\n\n$1=f(0)=0+2+c$, so $c=-1$\n\n$f(x)=3x+2e^{-x}-1$",
