   "part": null,
   "latex": "$y'=2e^{2x}$, $y=e^{2}+1$ when $x=1$.\n\n$m_T=2e^{2}$, so $m_N=\\dfrac{-1}{2e^{2}}$\n\n$y-(e^{2}+1)=\\dfrac{-1}{2e^{2}}(x-1)$\n\n$y=\\dfrac{-1}{2e^{2}}x+\\dfrac{1}{2e^{2}}+e^{2}+1$\n\nor $y=\\dfrac{-1}{2e^{2}}x+\\dfrac{1+2e^{4}+2e^{2}}{2e^{2}}$\n\nor $x+2e^{2}y-(1+2e^{4}+2e^{2})=0$",
