   "part": "b",
   "latex": "$A=\\left|\\displaystyle\\int_{-1}^{0}(e^{x}-1)\\,dx\\right|+\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}(e^{x}-1)\\,dx$\n\n$=\\left|\\left[e^{x}-x\\right]_{-1}^{0}\\right|+\\left[e^{x}-x\\right]_{0}^{1}$\n\n$=\\left|e^{0}-0-(e^{-1}+1)\\right|+(e^{1}-1)-e^{0}$\n\n$=\\left|1-\\dfrac1e-1\\right|+e-2$\n\n$=e+\\dfrac1e-2$",
