   "latex": "At $t=0$, $h=50$ cm. $\\dfrac{dh}{dt}=-0.5t$\n\n$h=-0.5\\dfrac{t^{2}}{2}+c=-\\dfrac{t^{2}}{4}+c$\n\n$50=0+c$, so $c=50$, $h=-\\dfrac{t^{2}}{4}+50$\n\n$0=-\\dfrac{t^{2}}{4}+50$, $t^{2}=200$\n\n$t=\\sqrt{200}\\approx 14$ min $9$ sec (ignore negative)",
   "marks_breakdown": "2: correct time; 1: correct expression for h",
